  "problem": "A robotic rover moves in a straight line with velocity \n$v(t)=3{t}^{2}-t,$ where $t$ is measured in seconds and $v$ is measured in meters per second. \n\nFind the average acceleration ${a}_{\\text{avg}}$ of the rover over the time interval $t\\in [0,2].$ Do not round your answer.\n\n${a}_{\\text{avg}}=$ \n{{field-1}}\n${\\text{m/s}}^{2}$",
